{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/77c685e5925d712e25a2c1f2e78bf225.avif?t=1768598839\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras_big/77c685e5925d712e25a2c1f2e78bf225.avif?t=1768598839 width=800 height=114 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short Sci-fi adventure game made for the Game Boy Color in GB Studio! Solve puzzles, collect energy for your weapons, and fight the alien Ackloids to claim the planet Proxima B for the humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/1fbbce8422c6d485900fb7ad7c1ff06c.avif?t=1768598839\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras_big/1fbbce8422c6d485900fb7ad7c1ff06c.avif?t=1768598839 width=800 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-based level progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies and creatures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 levels, each with unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full 8-bit soundtrack and art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player color customizer</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/dd57cf908eed23dff72bfea46009d7d5.avif?t=1768598839\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras_big/dd57cf908eed23dff72bfea46009d7d5.avif?t=1768598839 width=800 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/f3caa41971f9bd38e562768b0f5d8a30.avif?t=1768598839\" width=208 height=208 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Earth is in ruins after a large asteroid hit it about 10 years ago. You sign up to be an IASA Combat Astronaut to help fix your home world, as well as find a new one. You were assigned to help survey the land and &quot;tame&quot; the planet for human colonization. But, disaster strikes when you  and your co-pilot, Xelendra (Xel), land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/3cb702f9c160b7d6956a9905d9c4a2b6.avif?t=1768598839\" width=208 height=208 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Another alien race, the Ackloids, are attempting to colonize the planet for themselves and  aren't up for any negotiations. With an attack on the human command ship, the only other human who can help is an injured Xel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you have what it takes to defeat the Ackloids and save the human race? Find out in</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/25c6f9986e8abd4b3a5b01010abdad03.avif?t=1768598839\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras_big/25c6f9986e8abd4b3a5b01010abdad03.avif?t=1768598839 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/95a1996764db483343f5e39bead1fcb5.avif?t=1768598839\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras_big/95a1996764db483343f5e39bead1fcb5.avif?t=1768598839 width=800 height=114 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles with buttons, your energy weapons, and creatures to open doors. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/afcf4b6c453494e071afa7862f0a6659.poster.avif?t=1768598839\" width=400 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718720/extras/afcf4b6c453494e071afa7862f0a6659.webm?t=1768598